# Personal, per-machine. All three are optional at runtime:
# no skins -> Webamp's base skin, no feeds.json -> Hacker News,
# no settings.json -> defaults. Drop your own .wsz in renderer/skins/.
# Winamp5_Classified_v5.5 is the exception: it ships, it's FALLBACK_SKIN.
renderer/skins/*
!renderer/skins/Winamp5_Classified_v5.5.wsz
feeds.json
settings.json
